	Inspired by some recent mentions of odd deaths, I was able to dig up
a few more:
killed by genocidal confusion.
killed by an imperious order.
killed by a residual undead turning effect.
killed by colliding with the ceiling.
killed while stuck in creature form.
fell into a chasm.
killed by sipping boiling water.
killed by tasting <something petrifying> meat.
killed himself with his bullwhip.
went to heaven prematurely.
killed by deliberately meeting Medusa's gaze.

	I know we've seen a few of these here, while others are rarer.  For
example, the last one requires you to be polymorphed into something with
a gaze attack and use it against an awake Medusa; I doubt too many
people have tried that.  TDTTOE.

